{"file": "觉醒伪神：神明弃我我自为神8-第26集.mp4", "ep": 26, "duration": 50.0, "segments": [{"start": 0.59, "end": 1.59, "text": "他们跪他们的"}, {"start": 1.59, "end": 2.59, "text": "咱们趴着"}, {"start": 2.59, "end": 3.59, "text": "别给自己加动作"}, {"start": 4.98, "end": 5.98, "text": "装祸"}, {"start": 6.98, "end": 7.98, "text": "花师姐"}, {"start": 7.98, "end": 8.98, "text": "你不受影响"}, {"start": 8.98, "end": 9.98, "text": "真厉害"}, {"start": 9.98, "end": 10.98, "text": "废话"}, {"start": 10.98, "end": 11.98, "text": "他敢"}, {"start": 11.98, "end": 13.98, "text": "那个吃醋精分分钟过来"}, {"start": 13.98, "end": 14.98, "text": "你们先趴着"}, {"start": 14.98, "end": 15.98, "text": "他不会杀小贝"}, {"start": 15.98, "end": 17.98, "text": "他把脸看得比命重要"}, {"start": 17.98, "end": 19.98, "text": "还不是一大气小拉偏架"}, {"start": 19.98, "end": 20.98, "text": "比我还不要脸"}, {"start": 20.98, "end": 21.98, "text": "甚严"}, {"start": 21.98, "end": 22.98, "text": "神座威严"}, {"start": 22.98, "end": 23.98, "text": "从不会偏私"}, {"start": 23.98, "end": 25.07, "text": "别抬头"}, {"start": 25.07, "end": 27.07, "text": "老子偏不服"}, {"start": 27.07, "end": 28.07, "text": "闷儿"}, {"start": 28.07, "end": 29.07, "text": "把我头扶起来"}, {"start": 29.07, "end": 31.07, "text": "目之的面子不能丢"}, {"start": 32.14, "end": 33.14, "text": "我已经瞪他了"}, {"start": 33.14, "end": 35.14, "text": "能抬头我看看"}, {"start": 35.14, "end": 37.14, "text": "看地上别光看我"}, {"start": 37.14, "end": 39.39, "text": "老子从反光里看的"}, {"start": 39.39, "end": 40.39, "text": "回去就说"}, {"start": 40.39, "end": 41.39, "text": "我敢瞪神座"}, {"start": 41.39, "end": 42.39, "text": "你不敢"}, {"start": 42.39, "end": 43.39, "text": "莎莎"}, {"start": 43.39, "end": 44.39, "text": "有没有化妆劲"}, {"start": 44.39, "end": 46.54, "text": "给我试试"}, {"start": 46.54, "end": 47.54, "text": "我的劲"}, {"start": 47.54, "end": 48.54, "text": "别装"}, {"start": 48.54, "end": 49.54, "text": "手也会压冰圈"}]}